  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A rigid wire consists of a semicircular portion of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> and two straight sections. The wire is partially immerged in a perpendicular magnetic field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> as shown in figure. The magnetic force on the wire if it has a current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math> is :</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/94411524-6488-4ba1-a44a-1c0ffe8f7368.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 246px;\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "n0O6T",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DiymO",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NGPpd",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qsmr9",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mover><mrow><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
